{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ceremony plays once more, it's hazy decor forming one last time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/5a7a7af7b3e3635715718695f7fcc8de.poster.avif?t=1757586725\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/5a7a7af7b3e3635715718695f7fcc8de.webm?t=1757586725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/5a7a7af7b3e3635715718695f7fcc8de.mp4?t=1757586725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A mishapen, impossible hotel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with different characters and objects through point &amp; click controls, follow them around or let them follow you. Explore locations that feel distantly palpable, an approximation of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/7a8750c24198aebe2731d7d8b709cfec.poster.avif?t=1757586725\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/7a8750c24198aebe2731d7d8b709cfec.webm?t=1757586725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/7a8750c24198aebe2731d7d8b709cfec.mp4?t=1757586725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mingle to your heart's content.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange information extensively, debate on the general decor, or partake in backwards philosophy. It'll help out eventually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/cea75ca9da23a96fed0a526ff8ec3806.poster.avif?t=1757586725\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/cea75ca9da23a96fed0a526ff8ec3806.webm?t=1757586725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/cea75ca9da23a96fed0a526ff8ec3806.mp4?t=1757586725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Performative, romantic and classical.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a performer, murderer and master. Intertwine their stories and bring the ceremony to a halt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameevolves depending on who is being played, ranging from slow-paced exploration to having a literal gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/093d543887a1cb9d44de081451832e42.poster.avif?t=1757586725\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/093d543887a1cb9d44de081451832e42.webm?t=1757586725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617650/extras/093d543887a1cb9d44de081451832e42.mp4?t=1757586725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reveal the horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recall long-forgotten events from a distant reality, and get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/i